615040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1061504001:1":{"text":"알로...! 다행이야, 무사하구나!","source_cn":"阿萝——！太好了，你没出事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DCB61041324255E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1061504002:1":{"text":"알로를 찾아주셔서 감사해요, <male>형</male><female>누나</female>!","source_cn":"谢谢你帮我找到阿萝，<male>哥哥</male><f...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x351DA92CFC7D4616","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"알로를 찾아주셔서 감사해요, <male>형</male><female>누나</female>!","female":"알로를 찾아주셔서 감사해요, <male>형</male><female>누나</female>!","variant_male_record_index":"113010","variant_female_record_index":"113011","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1061504003:1":{"text":"흑흑, 알로... 어디 갔었어? 내가 얼마나 걱정했는지 알아?","source_cn":"呜呜，阿萝……你跑哪去了？你知道我有多担心吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A275C19E65AB26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1061504003":{"text":"흑흑, 알로... 어디 갔었어? 내가 얼마나 걱정했는지 알아?","source_cn":"呜呜，阿萝……你跑哪去了？你知道我有多担心吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A275C19E65AB26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1061504004:0":{"text":"서쪽... 아! 우리에게 한턱 크게 쏜 그 마을 사람 찾으러 간 거지?!","source_cn":"西边……啊！你肯定又去找那个请我们吃大餐的村民了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FFD1811B259ACE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1061504005:1":{"text":"알로, 이 녀석! 그렇게 많이 먹으면 안 된다고 했잖아. 그리고 매번 다른 사람한테 가서 크게 한 상 차려달라고 하는 것도 안 돼!","source_cn":"阿萝，你这个坏小孩！我都说了，你不能吃那么多，更不能每...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E7237136BD901A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1061504006:1":{"text":"다음에 또 그러면... 다시는 열매를 안 줄 거야!","source_cn":"下次再这样……我就再也不给你果子吃了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x772FFD6DF6E24056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"서쪽으로 갔어","source_cn":"它跑到西边去了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x399E7B25BFC1532A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"서쪽으로 갔어","female":"서쪽으로 갔어","variant_male_record_index":"61796","variant_female_record_index":"61797","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:米莱迪":{"text":"밀라디","source":"米莱迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":1}}}}